    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "Experience the fusion of Racing and Skateboarding \u2013 with a touch of Chaos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skate &amp; Car Physics</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's a car? It's a skate? Nope... It's both! Flex Riders introduces a unique vehicle physics that combines skateboarding and racing. <br>Perform stunning tricks like flips, 360s, grinds, manuals, wallrides, and fakies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Items</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unleash mayhem with an arsenal of combat items earned through daring stunts. <br>Chain these items together to create spectacular combos that leave your opponents in the dust.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Split Screen &amp; Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/52ad9fc23ddab990bd66c748101de1f3.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/52ad9fc23ddab990bd66c748101de1f3.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/52ad9fc23ddab990bd66c748101de1f3.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge your friends in split-screen battles or take on opponents from around the world in online game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Race Track</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/4811966e6389c57d0e7d14bb04bd1835.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/4811966e6389c57d0e7d14bb04bd1835.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/4811966e6389c57d0e7d14bb04bd1835.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every round, the map changes! <br>Race tracks are randomly generated for maximum replayability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score System</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/1e1e3843ba269fd155b893c5ba9e7573.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/1e1e3843ba269fd155b893c5ba9e7573.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/1e1e3843ba269fd155b893c5ba9e7573.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Winning isn't just about crossing the finish line first in Flex Riders. <br>Score points by taking down opponents or pulling off the most impressive tricks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Innovative Skate &amp; Car Physics</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Combat Items</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Local and Online Multiplayer</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Procedural Maps</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Scoring System</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Experience the fusion of Racing and Skateboarding \u2013 with a touch of Chaos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skate &amp; Car Physics</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/9eb3a5f7630dadea3a3058b9266a056b.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It's a car? It's a skate? Nope... It's both! Flex Riders introduces a unique vehicle physics that combines skateboarding and racing. <br>Perform stunning tricks like flips, 360s, grinds, manuals, wallrides, and fakies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Items</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.poster.avif?t=1749057660\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.webm?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/e9bee57b61609aa2bcd8f5f45e95b1ae.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unleash mayhem with an arsenal of combat items earned through daring stunts. <br>Chain these items together to create spectacular combos that leave your opponents in the dust.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local Split Screen &amp; Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\