ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999130/extras/1e1e3843ba269fd155b893c5ba9e7573.mp4?t=1749057660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Winning isn't just about crossing the finish line first in Flex Riders. <br>Score points by taking down opponents or pulling off the most impressive tricks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Innovative Skate &amp; Car Physics</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Combat Items</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Local and Online Multiplayer</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Procedural Maps</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Scoring System</strong></li></ul>",
